<title>ITALY: Italy's Ambroveneto opens Manila office.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ambroveneto opens Manila office.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian banking group Banco Ambrosiano Veneto said it has opened a representative office in the Philippine capital of Manila.</p>
<p>The bank already has a branch in London and offices in Brussels, Hong Kong, Beijing, Moscow, New York, Athens and Bombay.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
